### Test Garden service (chuoi tuoi cay) bang extension REST Client trong VS Code
### Can chay: Docker, Identity (5101), Garden (5103). Muon thay thong bao: chay them Notification (5105)
@host = http://localhost:5103
@identity = http://localhost:5101

### 1. Service con song khong -> 200 {"status":"ok"}
GET {{host}}/health

### 2. Dang nhap lay token
# @name login
POST {{identity}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "champ@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 3. Xem chuoi hien tai -> 200. Nguoi moi: current = 0, wateredToday = false
GET {{host}}/api/garden/streak
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Ghi nhan tuoi cay hom nay -> 200, firstTimeToday = true, streak.current = 1
POST {{host}}/api/garden/watering
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Tuoi lan 2 trong ngay -> 200, firstTimeToday = false, streak.current van = 1 (khong tang)
POST {{host}}/api/garden/watering
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6. Xem lai chuoi -> wateredToday = true, week co ngay cuoi la true
GET {{host}}/api/garden/streak
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7. Khong gui token -> 401 (bao mat)
GET {{host}}/api/garden/streak

### 8. Token sai -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/garden/streak
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi
